.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_RISCV_ATTRIBUTE_TAG_AT 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_riscv_attribute_tag_at
.Nd return the tag value of a parsed RISC-V attribute entry
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft uint32_t
.Fn elf_riscv_attribute_tag_at "const elfobj_t *obj" "size_t index"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn elf_riscv_attribute_tag_at
function returns the tag identifier for the RISC-V attribute at
.Fa index
in
.Fa obj .
.Pp
Use
.Fn elf_riscv_attribute_count
first to bound valid indices.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the tag value on success.
Returns 0 when
.Fa index
is out of range or
.Fa obj
is NULL.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_riscv_attribute_count 3 ,
.Xr elf_riscv_attribute_value_at 3 ,
.Xr elfobj 3
